  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/ssc-cgl-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</a></span> has release the Marks, Final Answer Key for the post of Combined Graduate Level CGL Examination 2025 now. This recruitment was released for 15130 posts. <span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">Applications for the SSC CGL Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 09 June 2025, to 04 July 2025. The tier II examination was held</span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"> on 18-19 January 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their SSC CGL Marks, Final Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">SSC CGL Tier-II Marks, Final Answer Key 2026 </span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>09 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>04 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>05 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date : <strong>09-11 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>12th to&nbsp;26th September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>03 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>09 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Re-Exam Date :<strong>&nbsp;14 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Re-Exam City :<strong>&nbsp;05 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Re-Exam Admit Card :<strong>&nbsp;09 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>16 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Available : <strong>18 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Final Answer Key/ Marks :<strong>&nbsp;09 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Tier-II Exam Date <strong>: 18, 19 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Tier-II Exam City Released<strong> : 09 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Tier-II Admit Card<strong> : 15 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <strong>30 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Post Preference Form :<strong> 09-13 March 2026 (Extended)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Final Result :<strong> 08 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Marks, Final Answer Key : <strong>17 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female : <strong>0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Correction Charges :</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">First Time&nbsp;<strong>: Rs. 200/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Second Time&nbsp;<strong>: Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC CGL Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 August 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>27-32 Years (Post Wise)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per SSC Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC CGL 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 15130 Post</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Combined Graduate Level CGL Examination</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">15130</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SSC CGL Recruitment 2025 : Group Wise Post Details</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.9468%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Group Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 67.0532%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.9468%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Group A</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 67.0532%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Audit Officer-Indian Audit &amp;Accounts Department under CAG</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Accounts Officer-Indian Audit &amp;Accounts Department under CAG</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Section Officer-Central Secretariat Service</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.9468%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Group B</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 67.0532%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Section Officer-Intelligence Bureau</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Section Officer-Ministry Of Railway</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Section Officer-Ministry of External Affairs</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant section Officer-AFHQ</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant-Other Ministries/Departments/Organizations</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant- Other Ministries/Departments/Organizations</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Inspector of Income Tax-CBDT</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Inspector (Central Excise)-CBEC</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Inspector (Preventive Officer)-CBEC</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Inspector (Examiner)-CBEC</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Enforcement Officer-Directorate of Enforcement Department of Revenue</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Sub Inspector-Central Bureau of Investigation</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Inspector Posts-Department of Post</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Divisional Accountant-Offices Under CAG</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Inspector-Central Bureau of Narcotics</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Sub Inspector-National Investigation Agency (NIA)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.9468%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Group C</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 67.0532%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Junior Statistical Officer-M/o Statistics &amp; Programme Implementation</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Auditor-Offices under CAG</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Auditor-Offices under CGDA</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Auditor-Other Ministry/Departments</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Accountant-Offices under C&amp;AG</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Accountant/Junior Accountant-Other Ministry Department</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.9468%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Group D</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 67.0532%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Senior Secretariat Assistant/Upper Division Clerks-Central Govt Offices/Ministries other than CSCS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tax Assistant-CBDT</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tax Assistant-CBEC</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Sub-Inspector- Central Bureau of Narcotics</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Upper Division Clerks- Dte. Gen Border Road Organization (Only for Male Candidates</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SSC Stenographer C, D Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.3548%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.6452%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.3548%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Statistical Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.6452%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have completed their&nbsp;Graduation degree in any stream with at least 60% marks in Mathematics at the 12th standard level, or they should have a Bachelor’s degree with Statistics as one of the subjects.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.3548%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All other Posts</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.6452%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have completed their Graduation in any stream from a recognized university will be eligible for the CGL Examination, 2025.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download SSC CGL Tier-II Marks, Final Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Open on the region wise <strong>Download Tier-II Marks, Final Answer Key</strong>&nbsp;link from the <strong>Important Links </strong>box placed below.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In this page, candidates have to fill up the&nbsp; required fields given as following:</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration ID/ Roll Number/ Name</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Date of Birth </strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Father’s Name (In case of searching by name) </strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captcha code</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">And Click on <strong>Search </strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After submitting the correct details, applicants will be able to download the Marks, Final Answer Key.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC CGL Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-I Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-II Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.c